  "description": "A Black woman standing on a beach, wearing a black swimsuit and a pink visor. She is looking directly at the camera with a neutral to slightly displeased expression. Her body appears to be overweight, and she is holding the hem of her swimsuit. The image is framed to focus on her upper body and face, with the beach and ocean in the background. The text overlay reads 'i don't like the sun so i wear a visor,' which is a pun implying she wears the visor to avoid the sun, despite being on a beach.",
